                  {
                      "parameters":  {
                                         "content":  "## ðŸ’¸ Invoice Chaser â€“ polite reminders that get firmer\nEvery night at 9 PM: read your invoices sheet â†’ find unpaid invoices past their due date â†’ Claude writes a reminder whose tone matches how late it is (1-7 days friendly, 8-21 days firm, 22+ days final notice) â†’ Gmail sends it â†’ the sheet is updated so nobody gets two emails in one day.\n\n**Setup (10 min)**\n1. Google Sheet with headers: Invoice No, Client, Contact name, Email, Amount, Due date, Status, Reminders sent, Last reminder. Due date as YYYY-MM-DD. Status = Paid stops the reminders.\n2. **Read invoices** + **Update sheet**: connect Google Sheets and pick that sheet.\n3. **Claude**: add your Anthropic API key. Put your business name in the prompt.\n4. **Send reminder**: connect Gmail.\n5. Test with your own email in the sheet first, then Activate.\n\n---\nPart of **MAP â€“ 12 AI agents** (Kaamchor AI).",
                                         "height":  420,
                                         "width":  560,
                                         "color":  5
                                     },
